==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Gory]] (500%) spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Gory|Gories]] (400%) spawn, delay 1~2 seconds<sup>30f~60f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Use [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Cat]] and [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cat]] to stall the Gories that come out of the base. [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Sexy Legs Cat]] and [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]] can damage the Gories and eventually defeat them. You can also use [[Bird Cat (Normal Cat)|UFO Cat]] as they can outrange the Gories by a small bit.

